            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword With Sauce</strong> is a fast-paced stealth/action sandbox that puts you in control of how every mission plays out. With an arsenal of weapons and gadgets at your disposal, you can take on enemies however you see fit—go in loud, leave no witnesses, or strike from the shadows, eliminating foes without a sound.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/581630/extras/bc42f6ece3d8c5272f9e27fe05a58cb8.avif?t=1739220776\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of weapons suited for different playstyles, whether it’s deflecting bullets with a sword, taking out enemies from afar, or unleashing pure chaos with rapid firepower. Complement your arsenal with a range of gadgets, from tactical tools like gas grenades and ninja stars to the more unconventional pocket-sized black holes and explosive robotic crabs.<br>   <br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/581630/extras/f9a272937676f55d6c174da0648ddff7.avif?t=1739220776\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br>.<br>Each level is a playground of possibilities, giving you total freedom to experiment, adapt, and take down enemies in creative ways. Whether you prefer calculated precision or all-out mayhem, <strong>Sword With Sauce</strong> lets you become the ultimate assassin on your terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword With Sauce</strong> is a fast-paced stealth/action sandbox that puts you in control of how every mission plays out. With an arsenal of weapons and gadgets at your disposal, you can take on enemies however you see fit—go in loud, leave no witnesses, or strike from the shadows, eliminating foes without a sound.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/581630/extras/bc42f6ece3d8c5272f9e27fe05a58cb8.avif?t=1739220776\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of weapons suited for different playstyles, whether it’s deflecting bullets with a sword, taking out enemies from afar, or unleashing pure chaos with rapid firepower. Complement your arsenal with a range of gadgets, from tactical tools like gas grenades and ninja stars to the more unconventional pocket-sized black holes and explosive robotic crabs.<br>   <br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/581630/extras/f9a272937676f55d6c174da0648ddff7.avif?t=1739220776\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br>.<br>Each level is a playground of possibilities, giving you total freedom to experiment, adapt, and take down enemies in creative ways. Whether you prefer calculated precision or all-out mayhem, <strong>Sword With Sauce</strong> lets you become the ultimate assassin on your terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
            "short_description": "&quot;Espada com Molho&quot; (Sword With Sauce) é um jogo de ação furtiva de ritmo acelerado. Neste jogo, escolhes armas, gadgets e um estilo de jogo para eliminar inimigos. Podes entrar a matar ou permanecer invisível — a escolha é tua.",
